WEBVTT

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.620
Is this really going to be all right?

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.460
Stop making a fuss.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.630
As long as it's inside of this,
it's just a plain old piece of industrial art.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.590
It can't be! The restraints
are supposed to be perfect!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:03.680
I wonder if it's scared of me?

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.640
This is quite an impressive bit of smuggling.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:10.100
But if it wasn't,
it might not be worth hunting for.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.860
W-Who is this bitch?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.490
I am a <i>hexen</i>...

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.500
A request from a Mafia accountant?

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:35.880
According to the information we
received from a Militia dispatched to Chicago,

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:40.260
it looks like they plan on
using them as soldiers for their Family.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.300
I'd prefer it if they didn't pull us
into the disputes of this fleeting world.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.850
Ultimately, it's too much power for them.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:52.520
They will likely not know true
fear until it is right before their eyes.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:57.280
So, who is going to secure the smugglers?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:03.200
There was not a single
other Militia who was free.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.580
So this is her first
mission after being promoted.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.790
I wanted to see her off too.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.170
She was enthusiastic, wasn't she?

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.210
The problem is that she's <i>too</i> enthusiastic!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:17.380
It even looks like Elder has
given her some strange bullets too!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.420
There's a rookie with her after all,

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.300
so she does understand the situation.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.510
It would be nice if she did.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.310
What?

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:33.310
Hey, Rosette, is it really <i>this</i> warehouse?

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:37.690
That's strange.
This is where the transaction took place.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.530
What's wrong?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.990
Nothing. I'm just a little...

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.910
If you calm down and
do your work, you'll be fine.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:46.990
Right.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.910
Man! We come here all fired up,
and we find out we've been misled?

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.250
This is <i>so</i> disappointing! Jeez!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.090
Oh my...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.960
This is bad, it was the next one over!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:03:59.760
We're going!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.590
Right!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:22.740
Oh, no!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.500
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.120
No...

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.080
I see. Then hurry up and run.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.130
I can't believe that you
brought forth a corpse of this size.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.430
Take form...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.890
...my brave May!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:11.200
Rip them apart, like the glimmer
that twinkles in the new greenery!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.880
Wow!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.800
A jewel summoner...

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.640
Who in the world are you?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.270
You're from the Magdalene Order?

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.900
The warehouse!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.030
Has it gone berserk?!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.660
I won't let you get away!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.880
Are you planning on just leaving this?!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.050
Don't you people exist for times like this,

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:05.090
Miss Magdalene Sister?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.550
This is no joke!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.010
It's your mess, so you should clean it up!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.930
Azmaria, put up the barrier!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.850
Right!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.230
I guess I have no choice.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.070
We're going to clean this up quickly.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:27.240
I'm Rosette Christopher. And you?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.030
Satella, Satella Harvenheit.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.240
Okay, let's fight!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.260
One more left.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.350
Azmaria! Behind you!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.980
Azmaria!

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.650
Hot! Hot! Hot...!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.780
Why, you!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.700
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.080
Really, I'm all right.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:20.040
Why you, why you, why you, why you!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.120
I'm sorry. It hurts, doesn't it?

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:37.970
They bought time so they could run away
by releasing some of the merchandise.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.390
What are you thinking?!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.520
He was burned by
that holy water, wasn't he?!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.190
How can you be a Sister,
fighting alongside something like that?!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.690
What is he up to, trying to ingratiate
himself into the Magdalene Order?

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:53.490
Chrono is my valued partner!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.660
He's not like the others!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.870
No matter what form
he might take, he's still the same inside!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.870
He's a bloodthirsty monster!
A devil is a devil!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.830
What's your goal?! Hurry up and tell me!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Cut it out!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.090
Rosette!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.260
Please wait!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.390
Chrono isn't bad!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:20.970
I haven't known him that long yet, but...

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:22.430
He's very kind.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.770
Chrono is different.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:29.150
And besides,
there's lots of other evil people!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.780
I can't believe that the brilliance of
the stone would run out at a time like this.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.990
Just make sure that he doesn't devour you.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.040
Cut it out, Rosette.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.420
Don't you get mad when
someone says something like that to you?

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.260
It's not like she's wrong.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.510
Chrono...

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:05.690
Satella Harvenheit,
a bounty hunter that specializes in devils.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.150
She's commonly called the Jewel Witch.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.820
It seems that she
opposes devils indiscriminately.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.070
That's what it says.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.450
Yes! Yes!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.780
I'm sorry! Yes...

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:22.240
When I return, I'll be sure to... Yes.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.790
Was Sister Kate angry?

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.790
She said to continue my
investigation on foot for the duration.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:34.260
This time it was an act of God!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:38.800
I don't want to go through
the full course of submission!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.820
A devil...

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:18.880
A Militia of the Magdalene Order
had a devil as her partner.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.050
A devil?

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.850
Seriously, what is the world coming to?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.850
So, in the end,
you can't rely on anyone else?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.690
Lady Satella...

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:44.490
Damn it! The whole area is cordoned off,
and the cops are all over the place.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.620
Wait a second! What are you doing?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.620
Shut up! I'm not going to sit
here while they make a fool of me!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.570
This is...

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.740
It's best to not look much.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.660
This is gluttony,

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:27.240
desire that is intent
on greedily devouring life.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.960
It might be that of the dead.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.460
Your knowledge of
your own kind is impressive.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.590
You're the jewel woman from last night!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.510
Now what do you want?

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.970
I've come after
the smugglers. It's my job after all.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.100
Oh, so you've been up the whole time?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.180
I wouldn't do something as inefficient as that.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.060
Once I got the general information,

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.350
I went back home and
refreshed myself with a shower.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:59.070
Yet we've been walking around all night...

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.740
Which means
the damage is continuing to spread.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.070
Seriously, they are such a nuisance.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:08.200
Why has this happened?
Didn't you find the smugglers?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.080
I did. Just the corpses though.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.920
Perhaps it would be best to call them traces,

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.670
as it was much the same as the scene here.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.260
Did the smugglers unleash them?

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.010
Or did they break the seals themselves?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:28.060
Either way, it's the same.
Thanks to that, it's a big loss for me.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.890
Why are you saying it like that?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.270
I don't get paid for corpses.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.900
I don't work for charity like you do, Sister.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.770
We're putting our lives
on the line too, you know!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.440
Rosette!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.610
But why have you come all the way out here?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.490
You're not going to get paid, right?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.240
I am a pro.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:52.330
Once I've taken a job,
I will see it through to the bitter end,

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.580
no matter what.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.960
So you <i>do</i> have
a pretty good sense of responsibility.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.130
What's with you?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:03.760
We'll help you too.
After all, our goal is the same.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:10.220
Stop joking! I will not work with a devil!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.990
Don't follow me!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.830
You just happen to be walking in front of us.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.330
I'm following the devil's aura!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.870
So are we.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.960
How strange, I wonder why
we're going in the same direction?

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.440
Why do we have to run?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.730
Ask Rosette!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.660
And we've been up all night too!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.370
It's because you're
being competitive, Rosette.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.700
I may be stubborn,

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.290
but she's not too bad either.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.830
Well, thanks.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.260
What a delicious smell.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.390
Hot dogs!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.850
Food!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.470
I'll go buy some.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:39.270
Chrono! Put double mustard
and ketchup on mine! Got it?

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.810
No mustard on mine, please.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.980
Otherwise I won't be able to stop hiccupping.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.080
Here you go.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.430
You're so vulgar, opening your
mouth so wide here by the roadside.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.100
Is this even supposed to be food?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.440
You didn't even thank me, and you say <i>that</i>?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.610
There's not even
the slightest hint of a smoked scent to it.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:28.110
This scrap meat isn't like <i>wurst</i> at all.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:32.360
I believe you came
here from Germany, right?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.530
I'm sorry.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.660
You've got keen insight.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.580
I came to America just before
the Great War. It'll be ten years soon.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.130
Ten years...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.420
For work?

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:46.880
Searching for someone.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.470
I searched, and continued to search...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.340
Before I realized it, ten years had passed.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:56.180
I've pretty much
exhausted all of the clues I had,

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:59.140
and I've done everything possible, but...

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:02.850
In the end, all that's
happened is that time has passed.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.400
Then why don't you quit?

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.900
If you just keep on talking and talking,

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.400
you won't even be able
to find the things you could find.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.070
That's why it's taken you ten years.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.240
I'm amazed you haven't gotten tired of it.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.080
Rosette, you've said too much.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:29.590
We know how hard it is to continue looking
for someone year after year too, right?

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.850
Rosette!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.480
I'm sorry!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.230
Now you've done it!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:51.570
You guys! Line up over there!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.150
Azmaria, you come here too!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.280
What?! But, but...

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.490
There we go!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.840
I'm sorry. I'm sure Rosette
knows that she was wrong too.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.880
We're also looking for
Rosette's younger brother.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.850
So we really can understand
why you would feel impatient.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.770
But Rosette won't give up, no matter what.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.350
She says that if the wish is
strong enough, then it will come true.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.360
I'm sure, some day...

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.200
Oh, Sister, you kick too hard!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:51.920
Run!

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:15.940
Chrono!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.820
Azmaria, hurry up with the barrier.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:22.080
This is a rematch from yesterday. Hurry!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:22.950
Right!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.450
What in the world is that?!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.540
The cursed king of a foreign nation!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:31.330
The commission said that he was clad in
evil intentions, and came back from the dead.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:35.300
It seems that he let his familiars eat the
citizens in order to maintain his own longevity.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.970
That desire didn't end,
even with the death of his physical body.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.930
Then I'll stop it for him!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.190
The fourth one.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.280
Starting the barrier!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.660
I did it!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.710
Azmaria!

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.170
Let her go!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.060
He absorbed his familiars?!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.950
Why, you!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.330
No effect?!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:04.510
I'd be a laughingstock if anyone
ever found out I owed my life to a devil.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.800
Now's the time!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.890
Okay!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.890
Bring peace to the lost lambs,

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:14.310
give rest to the fangs of the wolf,

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.980
and call the hammer of death unto the devil!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.790
Are you all right, Chrono?

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.840
This is nothing. I'll be fine.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.840
More importantly, you did well, Azmaria.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.430
That's right. It's thanks to you
that there wasn't much damage.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:47.550
That's right, Azmaria,
so have confidence in yourself.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.470
Right!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:53.520
Well, about earlier...

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.440
I don't trust devils.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.110
I never have.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:20:59.440
I still don't, either.
